{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>雀巢三花三效高鈣較低脂奶粉750克（Nestlé Carnation Triple Care High Calcium Reduced Fat Milk Powder）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧、HKTVmall、Market Place及龍豐共5間零售商的網店報價。以同款單罐標價計，最低與次低相差HK$27.5，約17%。</p>\n<h2>雀巢三花三效高鈣較低脂奶粉750克各網店報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單罐標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單罐總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜龍豐</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$138</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$138</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單罐標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HKTVmall</td>\n<td>HK$165.5</td>\n<td>HK$165.5</td>\n<td>單罐標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$165.5</td>\n<td>HK$165.5</td>\n<td>單罐標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$165.5</td>\n<td>HK$165.5</td>\n<td>單罐標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Market Place</td>\n<td>HK$170.9</td>\n<td>HK$170.9</td>\n<td>單罐標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>雀巢三花三效高鈣較低脂奶粉750克單罐價錢點計？</h2>\n<p>買一罐雀巢三花三效高鈣較低脂奶粉750克，龍豐的同款網上標價為HK$138，較表列次低標價HK$165.5少HK$27.5。雀巢三花三效高鈣較低脂奶粉750克這個價差以單罐商品標價比較。若打算買多件，宜另計商戶的購買條件及結帳價。</p>\n<p>若買兩罐，屈臣氏與萬寧同日列兩件HK$219，屈臣氏列優惠至11月26日。Market Place列兩件HK$230。上面的單罐價差與兩罐優惠各自計算。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月16日商戶網上報價，未計運費，價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源：<a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/%E4%B8%89%E8%8A%B1-%E9%9B%80%E5%B7%A2%E4%B8%89%E8%8A%B1-%E4%B8%89%E6%95%88%E9%AB%98%E9%88%A3%E8%BC%83%E4%BD%8E%E8%84%82%E5%A5%B6%E7%B2%89-750%E5%85%8B/p/BP_807848\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/nestle-carnation-triple-care-high-calcium-reduced-fat-milk-powder-750g/p/926360\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.hktvmall.com/hktv/zh/main/about-Mart/s/H9140001/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E7%94%A2%E5%93%81/%E7%87%9F%E9%A4%8A%E5%A5%B6%E7%B2%89/%E9%9B%80%E5%B7%A2%E4%B8%89%E8%8A%B1-%E4%B8%89%E6%95%88%E9%AB%98%E9%88%A3%E8%BC%83%E4%BD%8E%E8%84%82%E5%A5%B6%E7%B2%89-750g-C3405/p/H9140001_S_SB_4891118024431\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HKTVmall</a><a href=\"https://www.marketplacehk.com/zh-hant/wellcome/p/%E4%B8%89%E8%8A%B1%E4%B8%89%E6%95%88%E9%AB%98%E9%88%A3%E5%A5%B6%E7%B2%89%20750GM/i/101850621.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Market Place</a><a href=\"https://eshop.lungfung.hk/product/fdn211707/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">龍豐</a></p>\n<p>這款奶粉屬含鈣的乳製品。鈣是維持骨骼和牙齒結構所需的礦物質，亦參與正常肌肉活動。如對成分或服用有疑問，建議先諮詢醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。<a href=\"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/Calcium-Consumer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIH：鈣的消費者資料</a></p>\n<p>計算方法：（較高標價－較低標價）÷較高標價×100%。本次以（HK$165.5－HK$138）÷HK$165.5×100%計，約17%。上述比例未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17947629257125729_8394381286af9e8aea4613.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"雀巢三花三效高鈣較低脂奶粉750克格價：龍豐 HK$138，單罐約平17%\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17947629257125729_8394381286af9e8aea4613.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>點樣先可以用圖中價格買到雀巢三花三效高鈣較低脂奶粉750克？<i></i></p>\n<p>以2026年11月16日網上報價，龍豐的單罐商品總額為HK$138。條件為單罐標價，未計運費。</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>本次比較三效高鈣較低脂750克罐裝。1.6公斤裝及其他三花奶粉系列的價格分開計算。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T17:25:38.506578+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":987,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T17:15:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T23:02:25.859745+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T17:18:40.807937+00:00","content_hash":"d3f59a91f34818ac729aac18152335389088d30004ce4606813842d63d93f69f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}